{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_0_level_main_00-10_beg","groupId":"main_0","stageId":"main_00-10","title":"苦境","storyCode":"0-10","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"7dd67e8ec087327e1bf87b49bc25a47de58baec9586fcf247df600103f9b7636","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"何なんだ……この、女は……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"――その指揮、見るに堪えんな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"レユニオンがチェルノボーグの軍事拠点を制圧した際、その構成員たちは、精密機械のように効率的な動きをしていた。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"だが、それに対して貴様のやり方は、半ば錯乱状態の部下を無秩序にのさばらせているだけ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"虐殺、放火、そして狩猟に見立てた残酷な行為の数々……これらはすべて、貴様の残忍な嗜好を満たすためだけのものだろう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"この状況でこうした蛮行を働く人間に、都市のすべてを陥れるほどの策など、もたらせるはずもない。となれば、指揮官はほかにいるはずだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"その人物は恐らく、貴様に戦場のかく乱を命じたのだろうな。そしてその命の元、貴様は己の低劣な趣味に突き動かされて暴走した、というわけか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"――ファウスト。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"あいつを黙らせてよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ファウスト","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"……了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"ッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"くっ、今のは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――ニアールさん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"全員、構えろ！　あの狙撃手……かなり手強いぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"いくらニアールでも、もう一撃食らうのはまずい……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"下がってください、ニアールさん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"――いいや。今退くわけにはいかない。あの尋常ではない威力……あれが直撃すれば、部隊は壊滅的な被害を受けることになる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"ゆえに――私はここへ立つ。皆を守り抜いてみせる！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"……ファウストの砲撃が、防がれた……？　たった一枚の盾如きで……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"ありえない……そんなのありえない！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"……もう一度だ。もう一度やろう、ファウスト！　あいつをバラバラにしてやるんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ファウスト","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"――――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"っ……！？　――右か！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"いかん！　ニアール――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"――そうはさせんぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Aceさん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"狙撃オペレーター、構えろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"目標、南方の高台！　撃てッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ファウスト","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"……ッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"何っ……！？　お前ら、よくも……！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"命中、したんでしょうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"そう簡単にはいかんだろうな……今のはあくまで、ちょっとした時間稼ぎさ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"とにかく、急ぐぞ！　連中に構っている暇はない！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"同感だ！　モタモタしていると、あの一撃をもろに喰らうことになりかねんからな……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"アーミヤ！　E3小隊が食い止めているうちに、打って出るぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"了解しました！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"――E1小隊の狙撃オペレーターは、私と一緒にレユニオンへの牽制を！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"E2小隊は、最大火力で包囲を切り崩してください！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"……どうして……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"どうして素直に死んでくれないんだ……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"お前たちの命運なんか、とっくに尽きてるはずなのに……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メフィスト","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"――こうなったら、全員まとめて――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"ニアール、今だ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"了解！　――E4小隊に告ぐ！　これより敵陣へ突入する！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"一気にたたみかけ、皆の道を共に切り開こう！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"――行くぞ、私に続け！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"撃て！　撃てーッ！　奴を近付かせるな！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"？　待てよ、いつの間に近付いてき――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"なっ……！？　う、嘘だろ！？　さっきまでもっと遠くにいたはず――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"ひっ、やめ――うわあああっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"甘い！　カジミエーシュの騎士を本気で相手取るつもりなら――あと数十年は訓練を積んでもらおうか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"――さあ、ドーベルマン！　私についてきてくれ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"了解！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["レユニオン構成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["ドーベルマン"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["ニアール"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["メフィスト"]},{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["ファウスト"]}]}
